        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/22/84496276/1ce09211f025bf5470682189e0837732_8428216260273986254.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>普通攻擊</color>\n造成1點 <color=#ff9999>火元素傷害</color> 。"
